note as BIZ_diagram_23_diagnostic_units
  BUSINESS PURPOSE
  Gives a diagnostic unit a first-class identity, its own governance boundary,
  professionals, specialties, study catalog, public profile and versioned prices.
  Clinical results remain in diagnostics; this module describes the provider
  and the services it offers to patients, doctors and insurers.
end note

